    "text": "livability.com\nwebsite\nLake Charles\nCHRISTUS Ochsner offers world-class health care in Lake Charles\n7 hours ago\nThanks to the advanced medical technologies offered at CHRISTUS Ochsner, Lake Charles, LA, residents like Sharron Thompson are receiving expert care locally. For Southwest Louisiana resident Sharron Thompson, early detection and the expert care she received at CHRISTUS Ochsner were lifesaving. “My husband noticed me being very short of breath,” says Sharron. Concerned, he brought her to their doctor. A routine heart scan detected a spot on her lung. A series of tests quickly confirmed she had stage I non-small cell lung cancer.",
